  <jpcrp_cor:AnnexedConsolidatedDetailedScheduleOfCorporateBondsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:27pt;"&gt;【社債明細表】&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;      該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AnnexedConsolidatedDetailedScheduleOfCorporateBondsTextBlock>
